1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:54,040
Among my 7 divisions of the Heavenly Fate Sect,

25
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,840
the Yellow and Violet divisions

26
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,640
still don't have Sons of Tian Yun.

27
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:02,720
Today is the day of the competition

28
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:06,360
for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

29
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:10,080
Are you all

30
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,960
ready to begin ?

31
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,440
The sect is flourishing

32
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,760
and its disciples are powerful.

33
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,600
But with the Heavenly Fate Sect's heritage,

34
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:21,680
how is it possible that not a single disciple has surpassed Ascendant ?

35
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,040
Disciple' cultivation is too shallow

36
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,080
and insufficient to compete with my Senior Brothers for the title.

37
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,440
Disciple gives up.

38
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,480
Disciple still needs to cultivate diligently.

39
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:31,960
Disciple is ashamed to give up.

40
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,240
Disciple forfeits.

41
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,520
Disciple isn't strong enough to compete.

42
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,960
Thanks to all my previous efforts

43
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,440
building relationships with other fellow disciples,

44
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:42,440
even Senior Brother agreed to yield to me.

45
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,160
Today, I will finally become

46
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,720
a Son of Tian Yun.

47
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:49,640
The Seven Sons of Tian Yun's status is sky high,

48
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,720
they even have a chance to receive a celestial spell.

49
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:56,440
Why would these disciples give up so easily ?

50
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,640
Yun Daozi ?

51
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,960
Master,

52
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,440
Second Junior Brother’s cultivation is profound

53
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:05,640
and he was just given a celestial artifact by Master.

54
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:10,360
He rightfully should become the Yellow Division's Son of Tian Yun.

55
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,520
Disciple wishes to forfeit

56
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,960
to protect my Second Junior Brother's Dao.

57
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,640
The Seven Sons of Tian Yun

58
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:21,760
are titles within our Heavenly Fate Sect

59
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:26,560
and also the name of my true direct disciples.

60
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,640
If you can maintain the title for a 1000 years,

61
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,840
Master

62
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:33,320
will teach you a celestial spell.

63
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,320
Kunpeng Zi,

64
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,720
you

65
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,880
should prepare yourself.

66
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,680
Disciple humbly follows your teachings.

67
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,680
I will not disgrace the name of Tian Yun.

68
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:47,360
Cultivate in seclusion

69
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,760
to understand this item.

70
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:54,520
Those with formidable strength don’t compete for the title.

71
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,240
They make everyone else fear them.

72
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,280
Thank you, Master.

73
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,920
Is there more than meets the eye

74
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,840
to this Son of Tian Yun title ?

75
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,480
Next up

76
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:09,440
is our Purple Division's

77
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:12,040
competition to decide the Son of Tian Yun.

78
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,480
Wang Lin,

79
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:14,920
Zhao Xinmeng,

80
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,120
Bai Wei,

81
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,440
are you three

82
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,040
ready to begin ?

83
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,040
Disciple gives up.

84
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,640
Seventh Brother...

85
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,640
If I give up too,

86
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:36,720
it would be too easy for you to obtain the title.

87
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,640
You and I shall fight

88
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,080
right here, right now.

89
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:44,680
Fourth Senior Sister never competed for the title before.

90
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,920
Why is she now challenging me now ?

91
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:52,000
If I have doubts about the Seven Sons of Tian Yun,

92
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,550
she must also have the same doubts.

93
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,200
Disciple

94
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,160
gives up.

95
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,840
Why are you giving up ?

96
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,040
Disciple’s cultivation is too low.

97
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,080
I'm unable to compete with Fourth Senior Sister.

98
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:10,440
Wang Lin !

99
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,440
Disciple' cultivation is too shallow

100
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,080
and insufficient to compete with my Senior Brothers for the title.

101
00:05:17,030 --> 00:05:19,080
Disciple isn't strong enough to compete.

102
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:21,080
Disciple is ashamed to give up.

103
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:21,080
...to protect my Second Junior Brother's Dao.

104
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,760
That feeling just now

105
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:28,240
was as if everything about me

106
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,040
was laid bare before him.

107
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,920
My disciples

108
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,440
shouldn't be cowards.

109
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,920
You shouldn't be bewitched by others

110
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,880
and should follow your desires.

111
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:44,080
I'll give you half an incense stick of time

112
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,320
to think about it carefully.

113
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,720
If you still decide to give up,

114
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,440
I won't stop you.

115
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:55,520
Master always lets disciples choose.

116
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,080
Why is he advising him today ?

117
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,880
Since Sun Yun,

118
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:02,640
the only disciple Master advised

119
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,680
is this Wang Lin.

120
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,720
Defying the All-Seer now is unwise.

121
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,360
Even if something's wrong about the Seven Sons of Tian Yun,

122
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,520
this duel

123
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,800
is unavoidable.

124
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:17,760
Disciple

125
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,240
will try his best.

126
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,440
Seventh Brother,

127
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,960
let's begin.

128
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,480
My Dao is

129
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,280
the Demon's Shadow.

130
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,040
As long as I see a spell once

131
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,840
and its requirements are not beyond my cultivation,

132
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:43,040
I can imitate a weaker version of it.

133
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,680
This spell

134
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,960
is my imitation of

135
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:48,200
the Demonic Finger you used before.

136
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,120
I call it

137
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,760
the Purple Demonic Hand !

138
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,760
Demonic Finger !

139
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,680
What an amazing demonic energy !

140
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,320
My Demon's Shadow imitation is still somewhat lacking.

141
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:07,960
Seventh Brother,

142
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,160
I won’t compete with you for the Son of Tian Yun title.

143
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:14,040
But this demonic energy

144
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,040
must be mine.

145
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,680
Senior Sister went to such lengths

146
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,920
to lure me into using the Demonic Finger

147
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,840
just to obtain its demonic energy.

148
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,760
If you had asked me directly,

149
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,920
Junior Brother might not have minded.

150
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,760
But now,

151
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,080
I won't let you

152
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,360
steal it !

153
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,520
Seventh Brother,

154
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,440
I just want a bit of your demonic energy.

155
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,240
This is very important for me.

156
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,480
If you agree,

157
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,040
I’ll give up immediately.

158
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,440
Otherwise...

159
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,160
I can't grant you

160
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,760
this favor.

161
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,280
Alright,

162
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,280
if you don’t use your Demonic Finger,

163
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,320
I wonder how long you'll last.

164
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,640
The Nine Cycle Celestial Refining Tactic ?

165
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,160
This spell is extremely difficult to cultivate

166
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,240
and I just gave him the jade slip.

167
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:09,880
How could he possibly

168
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,840
have already mastered it !?

169
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,000
Junior Brother,

170
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,720
your three cycles

171
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,320
are useless against me !

172
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:20,920
Now...

173
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,040
it’s five cycles !

174
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,040
This child...

175
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:35,640
Is he really a fit for my Dao ?

176
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,720
Back then,

177
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,800
he left me with a single phrase.

178
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,760
"My Dao

179
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,480
is the Dao of Heavenly Fate."

180
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,520
Only by finding people who fit my Dao

181
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,880
will I have a chance to enter the third step.

182
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,480
It's been more than 30 000 years

183
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:56,840
and I’ve already failed countless times.

184
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,040
Am I

185
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,680
doing it right ?

186
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,160
Am I wrong ?

187
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,760
Do you still want to see

188
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,840
my Nine Cycle Celestial Refining Tactic's strength ?

189
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,640
I really underestimated you.

190
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,040
Seventh Brother,

191
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,040
I give up.

192
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,960
Even Senior Sister Xinmeng couldn’t defeat him ?

193
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,960
Wang Lin is exceptionally talented.

194
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,400
The Son of Tian Yun

195
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,920
will be given to the new disciple ?

196
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:29,960
Indeed...

197
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,240
I'm so jealous !

198
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:34,160
When will we become Sons of Tian Yun ?

199
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,920
Such momentum...

200
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,160
This person’s cultivation

201
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,840
must be Ascendant.

202
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,800
Disciple Chen Tao

203
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,280
pays respects to Master.

204
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:49,280
Chen Tao
Heavenly Fate Sect
Purple Division disciple
Middle stage Ascendant

205
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,400
Chen Tao ?

206
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:57,240
If Sun Yun hadn't suddenly emerged back then,

207
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,640
the Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun

208
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:02,720
would likely still be Chen Tao.

209
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,720
You made it back in time,

210
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,240
very good !

211
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,240
Disciple originally wasn't going to be late

212
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:13,240
but when I passed planet Black Ink,

213
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:15,040
I saw a rare treasure there.

214
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,960
Disciple took a liking to it

215
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,640
and wished to gift it to Master.

216
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,520
That's why I was delayed.

217
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,640
What kind of treasure

218
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,440
caught your eye ?

219
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,640
Disciple found this on planet Black Ink,

220
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:29,040
3 high-quality Desolate Beasts were fighting over it.

221
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,080
Disciple was curious, so I took it.

222
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,160
Unfortunately, my knowledge is limited.

223
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,320
I don't know

224
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,960
what it is exactly.

225
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:42,320
This flower is called the Seven-Colored Glaze.

226
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,240
It takes 10 years to take root,

227
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,680
100 years to make leaves,

228
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,840
1000 years to make a bud,

229
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:49,800
10 000 years

230
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,320
for it to bloom.

231
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,080
After it blooms 7 times,

232
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:58,120
it releases a 7-colored light.

233
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,240
The Cultivation Alliance

234
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,640
ranks this item

235
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:05,960
as the 93rd heavenly treasure.

236
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,920
Elder Sun,

237
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:11,360
is this old man correct ?

238
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,480
That is correct.

239
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:17,600
This is indeed a Seven-Colored Glaze.

240
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:20,120
Senior All-Seer’s outstanding disciples

241
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:22,640
are truly a breath of fresh air.

242
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,440
Good...

243
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,880
I will

244
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:28,280
accept your gift.

245
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:29,640
Master,

246
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,720
disciple has returned

247
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:34,320
to reclaim the title of Son of Tian Yun.

248
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:37,280
I humbly ask for Master’s blessing.

249
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,800
The victor between you two

250
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:43,560
shall be the Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun.

251
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,440
You

252
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,600
should give up !

253
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,920
This isn't how

254
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,760
this spell should be used.

255
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,440
Only in the hands of an Ascendant cultivator

256
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,000
can this spell truly be called

257
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,640
the Nine Cycle Celestial Refining Tactic.

258
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,160
With such a low cultivation,

259
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:26,120
you're unworthy of being my Seventh Junior Brother !

260
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,120
Teleportation !

261
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,680
Teleportation

262
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:40,440
to turn his spell against him ?

263
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,440
That's a clever way to fight an Ascendant.

264
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:46,640
Those kinds of tricks won't change anything.

265
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,200
Are you trying to outsmart me ?

266
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,360
It's useless !

267
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,120
Beast Soul,

268
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,040
come out !

269
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:55,960
Devour him !

270
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,240
You snarling beast,

271
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,080
come and play with me !

272
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:04,160
God Slaying Chariot,

273
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,240
fifth seal,

274
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,440
release !

275
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,120
This is...

276
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:19,240
Interesting...

277
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:22,360
This fight against an Ascendant allows me

278
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:25,040
to use Chen Tao's strength to fight the Beast Soul

279
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,640
and lessens the backlash from undoing the seal.

280
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,960
That was my best opportunity to open the seal.

281
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,440
When I release

282
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,840
all 5 seals on this beast,

283
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,160
I wonder how powerful

284
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:37,880
the God Slaying Chariot will be.

285
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,000
Good !

286
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:40,920
Very good !

287
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,840
If you can subdue this beast,

288
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:46,160
then you're qualified to be my Junior Brother !

289
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:46,840
You

290
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:49,840
are not yet qualified to be my Senior Brother.

291
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,360
I'll take the time to fight this beast

292
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,560
and then I'll deal with you.

293
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,160
It doesn't change anything.

294
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,480
We will see

295
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,920
if I’m qualified !

296
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,200
Wang Lin,

297
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,880
do you dare to take my strike ?

298
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,240
Why would I not ?

299
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:17,280
This final killing spell has immense backlash.

300
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,280
Use it responsibly

301
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:21,640
before Late stage Soul Transformation.

302
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:24,360
You must wait until Ascendant

303
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:27,040
before you can use it freely.

304
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,160
Under...

305
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,440
world...

306
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:30,640
Finger !

307
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,640
This finger...

308
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:41,520
Why is it the same as that madman's

309
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,760
that I met earlier ?

310
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:50,320
The Life and Death Reincarnation Cycle Domain....

311
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,040
Here it comes !

312
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,040
He's only Soul Transformation

313
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:13,320
and he's able to push an Ascendant this far !

314
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,520
That's enough.

315
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:26,440
Master,

316
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,600
disciple gives up.

317
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,440
When you reach Ascendant,

318
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,920
we shall fight again,

319
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,240
Seventh Brother.

320
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:43,040
You are both my disciples,

321
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:45,480
don't be jealous of each other.

322
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,280
Chen Tao,

323
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,480
since you won

324
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,720
you shall be once more

325
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:54,320
the Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun.

326
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:58,240
This is not your first time receiving the title,

327
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:00,520
take your time to comprehend it.

328
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,680
Thank you, Master.

329
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:05,040
Now I'm sure that there is something else

330
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,440
to the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

331
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:09,360
Before I learn what that crystal is,

332
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:11,160
I mustn't become one.

333
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,040
Fortunately, Chen Tao returned.

334
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:17,080
Since I fought an Ascendant with all I have,

335
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,040
I avoided offending the All-Seer

336
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:23,000
and avoided becoming a Son of Tian Yun.

337
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,040
Esteemed guests,

338
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:31,040
this is the end of this old man's birthday.

339
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:33,680
Fellow cultivators, if you don't have urgent matters,

340
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:36,880
please stay at my Heavenly Fate Sect for a few more days

341
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:39,560
to discuss the Dao

342
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:42,360
and share our enlightenments.

343
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:45,440
Farewell, Senior All-Seer.

344
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,600
Wang Lin,

345
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,920
come with me to pay respects to the Ancestral Spirit.

346
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:54,240
Afterward, I will teach you a forbidden spell and give you a life-saving artifact.

347
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,280
From now on,

348
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:59,240
you officially become

349
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:01,760
my disciple.

350
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,480
Thank you, Master.

351
00:17:04,210 --> 00:17:13,520
"I always decide which
forbidden spell each student will learn, but if you can see through
the mysteries of this mountain, Master will break the rules and
let you choose whichever spell you want."

352
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:10,680
Three Black and White Peaks
Heavenly Fate Sect

353
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,560
Wang Lin,

354
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,560
what do you think of this place ?

355
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:19,880
This place is rich in cold Yin energy.

356
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:23,520
It's a great place to cultivate cold-type techniques.

357
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,600
Is that all ?

358
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,440
This mountain is completely black.

359
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:34,080
Even the snow falling on it is black.

360
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:37,360
However, this black snow isn't cold, it gives off a strange aura.

361
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,600
The central mountain's aura

362
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:40,840
is even stranger.

363
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,280
Oh ?

364
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:45,040
Continue.

365
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,880
This mountain is so strange

366
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:49,800
because I can sense

367
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:51,520
a hint of Life from it.

368
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,240
Although all beings possess Life energy,

369
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,160
it's the first time

370
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:59,040
that I have seen a mountain

371
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,120
with Life energy.

372
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,400
Is that all ?

373
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,160
It's not enough.

374
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,080
Master,

375
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,720
those two side mountains are fake.

376
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:23,240
This child's intellect is exceptional

377
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:25,440
and his domain is quite interesting.

378
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,840
He was able to use his domain

379
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:29,840
to see through my spell.

380
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:32,680
Detecting such clues with his Soul Transformation cultivation

381
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,280
is pretty impressive.

382
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:39,880
The All-Seer's cultivation is heavenly.

383
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,640
If not for Tu Si's memories

384
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,040
I wouldn't have seen the truth behind these mountains.

385
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:53,720
Judging from the All-Seer's reaction,

386
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,800
maybe...

387
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:59,880
he doesn't know that I have memories of an Ancient God.

388
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:06,800
Wang Lin,

389
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:09,440
Master will wait for you at the summit.

390
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:12,640
The first 100 steps will be easy

391
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:15,440
with your Soul Transformation cultivation.

392
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,240
But the final 100 steps to the summit

393
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,560
will depend on your fate.

394
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,280
Those final 100 steps

395
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:28,000
are what Master calls

396
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,560
the Shattered Land of the Celestials.

397
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:46,640
I've been walking this path for endless years

398
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:46,640
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

399
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:52,240
Is it the compass of fate

400
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:52,240
that wrote this outcome for us ?

401
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:58,160
The heavens want to erase your existence,

402
00:19:58,280 --> 00:20:03,880
that's the obsession guiding me.

403
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:09,480
Is this the path to uncover

404
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:09,480
truths from falsehoods ?

405
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:15,080
In a world of murk and shadow,

406
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:15,080
only the flame of truth can light the way.

407
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:20,800
Look at them all,

408
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:20,800
being carried by the waves.

409
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:25,440
Look at them all,

410
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,440
being drowned.

411
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:28,760
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

412
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:31,840
I will let the world refine my soul.

413
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:37,400
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

414
00:20:33,660 --> 00:20:37,400
I will fight.

415
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:40,520
I'll break through the abyss of despair

416
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:43,560
to finally learn who I really am.

417
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:48,920
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

418
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:48,920
I embrace this obsession.

419
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:51,880
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

420
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:54,680
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

421
00:20:54,680 --> 00:21:00,160
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

422
00:20:56,720 --> 00:21:00,160
I'll still fight.

423
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:03,520
It's hard to avoid loneliness

424
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:06,560
when you are above everyone else.

425
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:12,240
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

426
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:12,240
be afraid of a firefly ?
